{"availability":"available","full":"AlekseiLopatin/macro-calculated-meals","name":"macro-calculated-meals","description":"Macro-based meal plan & grocery list generator — filters a USDA-verified recipe library by calorie target and dietary restrictions, pay-per-plan.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-09T08:17:47Z","updated":"2026-08-03T06:28:44Z","branch":"master","homepage":"https://macro-calculated-meals.vercel.app/","topics":["grocery-list","i18n","meal-planning","nextjs","nutrition","omise","react","supabase","tailwindcss","typescript","vercel"],"demo":"https://macro-calculated-meals.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:16.038Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:16.038Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:16.038Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T21:28:16.038Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A macro-based meal-plan and grocery-list web app. You set a calorie target, dietary restrictions, and plan length; MacroKin filters a recipe library down to what actually fits, generates a day-by-day plan, and produces a shoppable grocery list — priced and checked out per plan (pay-per-plan, not a subscription).","There is no physical kitchen or delivery. This started as a meal-delivery business concept and was deliberately re-scoped to asset-light software: the product is the planning/filtering engine and the customer still shops and cooks. That decision trades a bigger addressable outcome (an actual delivery business) for something that's realistic to build and run alone."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AlekseiLopatin/macro-calculated-meals/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"7f6529ff819f772523c43602ae4c23abcbe74def08a64e1d918ffe2483cd53f5","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:16.130Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:16.130Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A macr